---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Footer from "../zh-cn/footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="黑白多工作室">
  <div 
    class="hero min-h-screen"
    style="background-image: url(/number-one-rich.png);">
    <div class="hero-content text-white text-center">
      <div class="max-w-md">
        <h1 class="mb-5 text-5xl font-bold color">刺激大富翁</h1>
        <p class="mb-5">
          《刺激大富翁》是一款需要策略、运气的桌面游戏，有8名玩家同场竞技。游戏采用即时制玩法，在游戏中通过掷骰子来移动步数，在地图上购买土地、建造豪宅，收取租金使对手破产，即可获得胜利!
        </p>
        <button class="btn btn-primary">
          <a
            href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/1455130"
            target={"_blank"}
          >
          STEAM
          </a>
        </button>
        <button class="btn btn-secondary">
          <a
            href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id1458195523"
            target={"_blank"}
          >
          APPSTORE
          </a>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex w-full flex-col">
    <div class="card bg-base-300 rounded-box grid place-items-center">
      <div class="divider">联系我们</div>
      <div class="divider">如需支持、疑问和建议，请发送电子邮件至</div>
      <div class="divider">sprite2345@gmail.com</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
